{"id":"c45e0059ab7065e5","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-letterless-normal-form.md","title":"Effective Letterless Normalization","display":"thm-letterless-normal-form — Effective Letterless Normalization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-letterless-normal-form","aliases":["89-thm-letterless-normal-form"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-letterless-normal-form — Effective Letterless Normalization","depends_on":["[[89-df-letterless-normal-form]]","[[89-lem-letterless-trace-code]]","[[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-letterless-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-letterless-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-letterless-normal-form — Effective Letterless Normalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"932deccafc8aeaa8\" href=\"?note=932deccafc8aeaa8\" title=\"89-df-letterless-normal-form\">89-df-letterless-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53fddde91ae3f682\" href=\"?note=53fddde91ae3f682\" title=\"89-lem-letterless-trace-code\">89-lem-letterless-trace-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a04766d8c28cddc\" href=\"?note=7a04766d8c28cddc\" title=\"89-thm-letterless-rank-trace\">89-thm-letterless-rank-trace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_0(A)\">\\(N_0(A)\\)</span> 是由有限/余有限迹码构造的正规形。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tr}\">\\(\\mathrm{tr}\\)</span> 为秩迹，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i=\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\land\\neg\\Box^i\\bot\">\\(R_i=\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\land\\neg\\Box^i\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n(A\\leftrightarrow N_0(A))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{tr}(R_i)=\\{i\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n(A\\leftrightarrow N_0(A))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{tr}(R_i)=\\{i\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 92–96；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tr}(\\Box^k\\bot)=\\{j:j&lt;k\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{tr}(\\Box^k\\bot)=\\{j:j&lt;k\\}\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i\">\\(R_i\\)</span> 的迹为单点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{i\\}\">\\(\\{i\\}\\)</span>。有限码的析取迹为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>，余有限码的合取迹为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus E\">\\(\\omega\\setminus E\\)</span>；两者都等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tr}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{tr}(A)\\)</span>。秩迹等价判据给 GL 等价。算法每步只处理有限集合或有限公式，无字母正规化在这里有全称正确性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-letterless-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"932deccafc8aeaa8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-letterless-trace-code","status":"resolved","id":"53fddde91ae3f682","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-letterless-trace-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-letterless-rank-trace","status":"resolved","id":"7a04766d8c28cddc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{LL}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"N_0(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tr}","display":false},{"tex":"R_i=\\Box^{i+1}\\bot\\land\\neg\\Box^i\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n(A\\leftrightarrow N_0(A))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{tr}(R_i)=\\{i\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tr}(\\Box^k\\bot)=\\{j:j<k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\{i\\}","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\setminus E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tr}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1311,"backlinks":[{"id":"0517fc365e0749bc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dc27d1abcea524e3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-letterless-formula]] → [[89-df-finite-frame-rank]] → [[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]] → [[89-df-letterless-trace]] → [[89-lem-letterless-trace-code]] → [[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]] → [[89-df-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-letterless-arithmetical-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["932deccafc8aeaa8","53fddde91ae3f682","7a04766d8c28cddc"]}